The openSUSE Leap and SUSE Linux Enterprise Server configs now use a single template per major version (`opensuse-leap-15.tpl`, `opensuse-leap-16.tpl`, `sles-15.tpl` and `sles-16.tpl`), and the release is set in each config file. The EOL openSUSE Leap 15.0 to 15.4 configs now use `cdn.opensuse.org` like the other openSUSE configs, which also fixes the updates repository of the openSUSE Leap 15.0 aarch64 config.
